{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "diagram_type": "workflow",
  "meta": {
    "title": "融合到底省了什么:同一次 GEMM 的两条写回路线",
    "subtitle": "C tile 本来就在 registers 里。上排不融合:写回 HBM、开新 kernel、读回来做 bias/ReLU、再写一次;下排融合:趁数据还在片上算完,bias/ReLU 全在 epilogue 里做掉,只写一次 D",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "output": "diagrams/cl-epilogue-fusion-io.workflow.html"
  },
  "lanes": [
    { "id": "ln_nofuse", "label": "不融合(两趟以上)", "variant": "exception" },
    { "id": "ln_fuse", "label": "融合(一趟)" },
    { "id": "ln_cost", "label": "两者的差别" }
  ],
  "phases": [
    { "id": "p1", "label": "在片上", "fromCol": 0, "toCol": 0 },
    { "id": "p2", "label": "过不过 HBM", "fromCol": 1, "toCol": 2, "variant": "emphasis" },
    { "id": "p3", "label": "最终写出", "fromCol": 3, "toCol": 3 }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    { "id": "a0", "lane": "ln_nofuse", "col": 0, "type": "database", "label": "registers 里的 C", "sublabel": "FP32 累加的部分和", "icon": "start" },
    { "id": "a1", "lane": "ln_nofuse", "col": 1, "type": "security", "label": "写 C 到 HBM", "sublabel": "整块 tile 落盘", "icon": "neutral" },
    { "id": "a2", "lane": "ln_nofuse", "col": 2, "type": "security", "label": "新 kernel 读回", "sublabel": "再做 bias / ReLU", "icon": "neutral" },
    { "id": "a3", "lane": "ln_nofuse", "col": 3, "type": "external", "label": "再写一次 D", "sublabel": "每多一层变换多一趟", "icon": "failure" },

    { "id": "b0", "lane": "ln_fuse", "col": 0, "type": "database", "label": "registers 里的 C", "sublabel": "同一个累加结果", "icon": "start" },
    { "id": "b1", "lane": "ln_fuse", "col": 1, "type": "backend", "label": "epilogue 里算完", "sublabel": "alpha·acc + beta·C", "icon": "active" },
    { "id": "b2", "lane": "ln_fuse", "col": 2, "type": "backend", "label": "bias / ReLU 就地做", "sublabel": "数据不落地", "icon": "active" },
    { "id": "b3", "lane": "ln_fuse", "col": 3, "type": "external", "label": "一次写出 D", "sublabel": "带类型转换与排布适配", "icon": "success" },

    { "id": "c0", "lane": "ln_cost", "col": 1, "type": "cloud", "label": "2 次以上内存往返", "sublabel": "逐个 element-wise 叠加", "icon": "none" },
    { "id": "c1", "lane": "ln_cost", "col": 2, "type": "cloud", "label": "1 次写回", "sublabel": "省掉的正是这 N 趟带宽", "icon": "none" },
    { "id": "c2", "lane": "ln_cost", "col": 3, "type": "cloud", "label": "代价:kernel 变胖", "sublabel": "寄存器压力↑ 占用率可能↓", "icon": "none" }
  ],
  "edges": [
    { "id": "e1", "from": "a0", "to": "a1", "label": "先把累加结果落地", "role": "main" },
    { "id": "e2", "from": "a1", "to": "a2", "label": "一整趟 HBM 吞吐", "role": "main" },
    { "id": "e3", "from": "a2", "to": "a3", "label": "算完再写", "role": "main" },
    { "id": "e4", "from": "b0", "to": "b1", "label": "同一份数据不出片", "role": "main" },
    { "id": "e5", "from": "b1", "to": "b2", "label": "线性组合后直接激活", "role": "main" },
    { "id": "e6", "from": "b2", "to": "b3", "label": "一次写回", "role": "main" },
    { "id": "e7", "from": "a2", "to": "c0", "label": "", "variant": "dashed", "role": "async" },
    { "id": "e8", "from": "b2", "to": "c1", "label": "", "variant": "dashed", "role": "async" },
    { "id": "e9", "from": "b2", "to": "c2", "label": "", "variant": "dashed", "role": "async" }
  ],
  "mainPath": ["b0", "b1", "b2", "b3"],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "两趟 vs 一趟的量级感",
      "items": [
        "不融合:bias+ReLU 至少 2 次往返(写 C、读 C、写 D)",
        "融合:registers 里算完 D=ReLU(beta·C+alpha·acc),只写 1 次",
        "每多融一层 element-wise 操作,就多省一整趟带宽"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "代价:kernel 变「胖」",
      "items": [
        "一次干更多活,寄存器压力上升、占用率可能下降",
        "compute-bound 的 GEMM 融合几乎总是纯赚;memory-bound 的逐元素算子收益更大",
        "epilogue 变换复杂且访问模式差时必须实测对比,别默认一定快"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "核心判断一句话",
      "items": [
        "GEMM 不是「算一次矩阵乘」,而是「主循环(计算密集)+ epilogue(写回+融合)」两部分",
        "主循环决定快不快,epilogue 决定省不省带宽",
        "优化 epilogue 就是优化融合与写回效率"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
